     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PXH01                     TEXT('FIXWDMPP OUTFILE')
     A            XHCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            XHFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            XHEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            XHDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            XHFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            XHDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Date' 'Maintained')
     A*** Fields from WDEHP
     A            XHFAF     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FINAL AUD. FLAG')
     A*** NEW MINIMUM PREMIUM
     A            XHWBAL    R     S         REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW WRT' 'BALANCE TO MIN')
     A            XHWAMAN   R     S         REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW WRT' 'ACTUAL MAN PRM')
     A            XHWASTD   R     S         REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW WRT' 'ACTUAL STD PRM')
     A            XHWANORM  R     S         REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW WRT' 'ACTUAL NORM PRM')
     A            XHWAANN   R     S         REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW WRT' 'ACTUAL ANN PRM')
